<shape type="text" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="22" width="700" height="34"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="22" color="rgb(36,49,65)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>三、CP-CLIP 与 CLIP：同一任务，两种解构</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="66" width="860" height="30"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="14" color="rgb(139,148,158)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>都做「图像 + 文本」分类，靠图文对齐；差别在于文本用什么、在哪个空间做结构化。</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="110" width="400" height="350" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill><border color="rgb(61,111,168)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="110" width="400" height="52" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(61,111,168)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="122" width="360" height="30"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="17" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>CLIP / CP-CLIP</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="182" width="356" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(61,111,168)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p><strong>文本来源</strong></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="206" width="356" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>原始医学报告，整份编码</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="248" width="356" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(61,111,168)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p><strong>解构的对象</strong></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="272" width="356" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>图像空间：核心区域 + 外围区域</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="314" width="356" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(61,111,168)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p><strong>对齐方式</strong></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="338" width="356" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>核心对外围分别对齐，再融合</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="380" width="356" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(61,111,168)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p><strong>没做到的</strong></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="72" topLeftY="404" width="356" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>拆完就停，未建模核心与外围的关系</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="110" width="400" height="350" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill><border color="rgb(46,125,91)" width="2"/></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="510" topLeftY="110" width="400" height="52" cornerRadius="10"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(46,125,91)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="530" topLeftY="122" width="360" height="30"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="17" color="rgb(255,255,255)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>M3GCD</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="532" topLeftY="182" width="356" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(46,125,91)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p><strong>文本来源</strong></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="532" topLeftY="206" width="356" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>结构化类别描述，扩散成软标签</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="532" topLeftY="248" width="356" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(46,125,91)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p><strong>解构的对象</strong></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="532" topLeftY="272" width="356" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>语义空间：类别与类别之间的关系</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="532" topLeftY="314" width="356" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(46,125,91)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p><strong>对齐方式</strong></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="532" topLeftY="338" width="356" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>类别描述扩散 + 软标签监督</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="532" topLeftY="380" width="356" height="26"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(46,125,91)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p><strong>差异</strong></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="532" topLeftY="404" width="356" height="40"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="13" color="rgb(36,49,65)" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>从图像空间迁移到语义空间做结构化</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="50" topLeftY="478" width="860" height="32"><content textType="body" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" fontSize="14" color="rgb(200,125,20)" bold="true" lineSpacing="1.35"><p>结论：CP-CLIP 拆「图内的主次」，M3GCD 拆「类别间的关联」—— 互补，不是竞争。</p></content></shape>
